mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Images   steps/
2. <each read_step; on_error=skip>   [image] -> [text]
     1. OCR              (input:1)
     2. Describe Image   (input:1)   LFM2-VL 1.6B; "What action is happening on
                                     this screen?"
     3. Template         (1,2)       "UI text:\n{1}\n\nWhat's shown:\n{2}"
3. Join Text     separator="\n\n## Step\n\n"
4. Draft         Qwen3 8B; "Turn these captured steps into a numbered
                 how-to guide"
5. Save Text     howto.md
